        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1456_5217.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, sampt was wir eeren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots vermoegendt, zuovor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">from</unclear> fürsichtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eehr</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> guott fründt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb Eydt-
<lb n="4"/>gnossen.,
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Was</unclear> wir verschiner tagen unsers burgers <persName resp="#ner">Liennhardt Kellers</persName>
<lb n="6"/>dochter, welche sich mit euwrem burger <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Gschwendten</persName>
<lb n="7"/>verheirath, unnd ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benandte</unclear> suma <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> bringen
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear>, intercedendo, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aprelen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürkherth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehandlet</unclear>, das selbig werden ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweiffels</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnne</unclear>, mit mererem
<lb n="10"/>haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstanden</unclear>.,
<lb n="11"/>Unnd haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moll</unclear> verhofft. Diewill unser burger
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mahl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bahr</unclear> das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerlegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unmoeglich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochters</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegt</unclear>, daß er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernendtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochterman</unclear> die
<lb n="14"/>versprochne. 50. gl. innert halbs jars frist erlegen soell ).
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würden</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernendtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwerm</unclear> burger und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">+</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">+</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frawen</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frawen</unclear> unsers burgers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochter</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> uff die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kurzo</unclear> zeit
<lb n="17"/>gedult tragen haben. Will nund aber sy taeglich nachmahlen
<lb n="18"/>von eüch angemandt, das woellen sy daß gelt nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bar</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>haben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ino</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgkrecht</unclear> bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abstrickt</unclear> sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelle</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>deßwegen uns besagter ir vater, nochmallen diemuetigst an-
<lb n="21"/>gebetten, eüch vonn sein und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochter</unclear> halb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuer</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/>bieten, das ir doch ino so günstig sein und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">klein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zidt</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>gedult tragen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herbst</unclear> halten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woelle</unclear>.,
<lb n="24"/>Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> wir dan ime dis sein begeren nit abschlagen
<lb n="25"/>woellen, so glangt deßhalben ahn eüch unser
<lb n="26"/>fründt: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eydtgnoesisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansinnen</unclear>, ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellt</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernendtem</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> dis <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orths</unclear> gedult tragen, sy fürter als zuovor
<lb n="28"/>für euwre burger erkennen, so ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermelter</unclear> ir
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vater</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nochmalen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dis</unclear> erbietens, das er was ime von
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1456_5218.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerfaren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seind</unclear> also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dis</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orts</unclear> so vil
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwisen</unclear>. also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vertrawen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear>,
<lb n="33"/>das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irs</unclear> gern wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegenhait</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueverschulden</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">götlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">threuclich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevehlendt</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="35"/><origDate when="1604" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Freütags</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear>. 15. tag. junij. anno. 1604</origDate>.,
<lb n="36"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> der
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schaffhusen</unclear></orgName>.,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1456_5219.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1456_5220.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="38"/>Denen frommen fuersichtigen er-
<lb n="39"/>sammen weyßen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd
<lb n="40"/>Rath der Stadt St. Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> insonders guoten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>.
</p>
